  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞再次来到节目走廊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞走在走廊上，\n　遇到了正在思考的直斗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 23 06}{F1 81}，辛苦了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我又试着和这个世界的居民们\n逐一交谈了一遍……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:1:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 06}果然还是不行。\n对话只能在“享受文化祭”的\n范围内成立。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:1:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 01 FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 47 06}现在明明急需任何有用的情报……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞直斗似乎正在调查学校内部……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞向直斗讲了Ｘ先生的委托。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9E 06}Ｘ先生……？\n简直是在主动宣称\n自己是可疑人物呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}是个什么样的人？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}这所学校的学生会长{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}这所学校的校长{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:4:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}真相尽在美食广场{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 06}刚才我去了主办处，\n和学生会长交谈过……\n他也和其他学生一样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞直斗似乎已经和对方交谈过了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 06}刚才在办公室里见过。\n和我们所知的八高校长\n不是同一个人。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:7:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}虽然试着和他交谈过……\n但也和其他学生一样。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞直斗似乎已经和对方交谈过了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 58 06}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5B 06}这种说法……真高明呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞直斗似乎产生了兴趣。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……要不要去，\n我再考虑一下。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 35 06}那么，我还要继续调查。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞直斗又开始沿走廊行走……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:12:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞这样就和八高组的\n　所有女生都聊过了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e800_824.bf.json:12:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞受邀的女生们\n　究竟会不会来呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
